{"additionalPlain":"Trilogy Federal is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.\n","additional":"<div><i style=\"font-size: 16px\">Trilogy Federal is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.</i></div>","categories":{"commitment":"Full-time Remote","department":"Operations","location":"Arlington, VA","team":"Information Technology","allLocations":["Arlington, VA"]},"createdAt":1787757213946,"descriptionPlain":"Trilogy Federal drives innovative solutions for complex business challenges across financial management, healthcare, and government industries. Our collaborative, client-first service approach, combined with our commitment to the rapid implementation of pragmatic solutions, has earned Trilogy an unparalleled reputation for delivering transformative results.\n\n\nTrilogy federal is seeking candidates for a new Informatics Program Analyst opportunity for a large federal customer. The Informatics Program Analyst will provide analytical support for healthcare informatics programs and initiatives within the Veterans Health Administration (VHA). The Informatics Program Analyst plans, analyzes, and evaluates program operations and business processes using qualitative and quantitative methods. The role analyzes source data, develops program metrics and reports, identifies trends and performance gaps, and provides recommendations to improve program effectiveness, workflows, and operational outcomes. The position requires relevant clinical informatics experience within a Veterans Administration healthcare environment. \nPlease note, this role is on a 9-month contract in which we are hopeful for an extension or additional work, but it may be only 9 months. Travel is listed as a possibility by our federal customer (short duration and small travel teams out of a much larger program).\n","description":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Trilogy Federal drives innovative solutions for complex business challenges across financial management, healthcare, and government industries. Our collaborative, client-first service approach, combined with our commitment to the rapid implementation of pragmatic solutions, has earned Trilogy an unparalleled reputation for delivering transformative results.</span></div><div><br></div><div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Trilogy federal is seeking candidates for a new&nbsp;<strong>Informatics Program Analyst </strong>opportunity for a large federal customer.&nbsp;The Informatics Program Analyst&nbsp;will&nbsp;provide analytical support for healthcare informatics programs and initiatives within the Veterans Health Administration (VHA). The Informatics Program Analyst plans, analyzes, and evaluates program operations and business processes using qualitative and quantitative methods. The role analyzes source data, develops program metrics and reports, identifies trends and performance gaps, and provides recommendations to improve program effectiveness, workflows, and operational outcomes. The position requires relevant clinical informatics experience within a Veterans Administration healthcare environment.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Please note, this role is on a 9-month contract in which we are hopeful for an extension or additional work, but it may be only 9 months.</span> Travel is listed as a possibility by our federal customer (short duration and small travel teams out of a much larger program).</span></p>\n</div>","id":"994af43f-ffa7-4cf6-9b9f-00f96833fcc6","lists":[{"text":"Primary Responsibilities: ","content":"<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Analyze and evaluate healthcare informatics programs, operations, workflows, and business processes to assess effectiveness and identify improvement opportunities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Collect, validate, manipulate, and analyze qualitative and quantitative data to support program evaluation and decision-making.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Develop metrics, reports, dashboards, and other analyses to communicate program status, performance, risks, and trends.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Identify operational gaps, issues, and process inefficiencies and develop actionable recommendations for improvement.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support EHR Go-Live, Post Go-Live, and informatics surge activities through data analysis, tracking, reporting, and program coordination.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Monitor program activities, milestones, risks, issues, and outcomes and provide timely status information to stakeholders.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support continuous process improvement by analyzing performance data and measuring the effectiveness of implemented changes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Collaborate with clinical informatics, program, and technical stakeholders to support program objectives and deliverables.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n</div>"},{"text":"Minimum Requirements: ","content":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Bachelor’s degree (BA/BS) in Health Informatics, Healthcare Administration, Business Administration, Data Analytics, Information Systems, or a related discipline.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Minimum of five (5) years of professional experience in program analysis, healthcare informatics, business analysis, operations analysis, or a related field.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Relevant clinical informatics experience within a Veterans Administration healthcare setting.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Demonstrated experience evaluating programs, operations, or business processes using qualitative and quantitative analytical methods.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"13\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience collecting, manipulating, analyzing, and presenting data to assess program performance and support recommendations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"14\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience developing program metrics, status reports, analyses, and other decision-support materials.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"15\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong analytical, problem-solving, written and verbal communication, and stakeholder collaboration skills.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"16\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ability to satisfy applicable Federal and VA personnel security, privacy, and information security requirements.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"17\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Potential travel is anticipated; must be able to support potential travel.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"18\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">The ability to obtain a Public Trust clearance.&nbsp; </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"},{"text":"Preferred Qualifications: ","content":"<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"19\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience supporting VHA clinical informatics, EHR modernization, or Post Go-Live operations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"20\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with Oracle Health/Cerner Millennium, VA VistA/CPRS, or related VA healthcare information systems.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"21\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience analyzing clinical workflows, operational metrics, end-user performance, or EHR-related business processes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"22\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with data visualization, dashboards, reporting, and performance measurement tools.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"23\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience supporting process improvement, issue management, risk tracking, or program performance evaluation.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"24\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Familiarity with SAFe® Lean-Agile principles and multidisciplinary healthcare informatics teams.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n</div>"},{"text":"Benefits (including but not limited to):","content":"<div>\n\n<li>Health, dental, and vision plans</li>\n<li>Optional FSA</li>\n<li>Paid parental leave</li>\n<li>Safe Harbor 401(k) with employer contributions 100% vested from day 1</li>\n<li>Paid time off and 11 paid holidays</li>\n<li>No cost group term life/AD&amp;D plan, and optional supplemental coverage</li>\n<li>Pet insurance</li>\n<li>Monthly phone and internet stipend</li>\n<li>Tuition and training reimbursement</li>\n\n</div>"}],"salaryRange":{"min":90000,"max":104999,"currency":"USD","interval":"per-year-salary"},"salaryDescription":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">This range is not a guarantee of compensation or salary, as Trilogy Federal conducts an individual equity review for every candidate based on experience, location, education, industry experience, and comparisons to internal pay bands. In addition to salary, Trilogy offers robust benefits including medical/dental/vision insurance coverage, 401(k) match, paid holidays, paid time off, tuition reimbursement, and a very supportive work/life balance.</span></div>","salaryDescriptionPlain":"This range is not a guarantee of compensation or salary, as Trilogy Federal conducts an individual equity review for every candidate based on experience, location, education, industry experience, and comparisons to internal pay bands. In addition to salary, Trilogy offers robust benefits including medical/dental/vision insurance coverage, 401(k) match, paid holidays, paid time off, tuition reimbursement, and a very supportive work/life balance.\n","text":"Informatics Program Analyst","country":"US","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Trilogy Federal drives innovative solutions for complex business challenges across financial management, healthcare, and government industries. Our collaborative, client-first service approach, combined with our commitment to the rapid implementation of pragmatic solutions, has earned Trilogy an unparalleled reputation for delivering transformative results.</span></div>","openingPlain":"Trilogy Federal drives innovative solutions for complex business challenges across financial management, healthcare, and government industries. Our collaborative, client-first service approach, combined with our commitment to the rapid implementation of pragmatic solutions, has earned Trilogy an unparalleled reputation for delivering transformative results.\n","descriptionBody":"<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Trilogy federal is seeking candidates for a new&nbsp;<strong>Informatics Program Analyst </strong>opportunity for a large federal customer.&nbsp;The Informatics Program Analyst&nbsp;will&nbsp;provide analytical support for healthcare informatics programs and initiatives within the Veterans Health Administration (VHA). The Informatics Program Analyst plans, analyzes, and evaluates program operations and business processes using qualitative and quantitative methods. The role analyzes source data, develops program metrics and reports, identifies trends and performance gaps, and provides recommendations to improve program effectiveness, workflows, and operational outcomes. The position requires relevant clinical informatics experience within a Veterans Administration healthcare environment.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Please note, this role is on a 9-month contract in which we are hopeful for an extension or additional work, but it may be only 9 months.</span> Travel is listed as a possibility by our federal customer (short duration and small travel teams out of a much larger program).</span></p>\n</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"Trilogy federal is seeking candidates for a new Informatics Program Analyst opportunity for a large federal customer. The Informatics Program Analyst will provide analytical support for healthcare informatics programs and initiatives within the Veterans Health Administration (VHA). The Informatics Program Analyst plans, analyzes, and evaluates program operations and business processes using qualitative and quantitative methods. The role analyzes source data, develops program metrics and reports, identifies trends and performance gaps, and provides recommendations to improve program effectiveness, workflows, and operational outcomes. The position requires relevant clinical informatics experience within a Veterans Administration healthcare environment. \nPlease note, this role is on a 9-month contract in which we are hopeful for an extension or additional work, but it may be only 9 months. Travel is listed as a possibility by our federal customer (short duration and small travel teams out of a much larger program).\n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/TrilogyFederal/994af43f-ffa7-4cf6-9b9f-00f96833fcc6","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/TrilogyFederal/994af43f-ffa7-4cf6-9b9f-00f96833fcc6/apply"}